      "writtenOn": "2026-01-20T22:06:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure I understand this, is it updating both for bufferView _and_ what would be just an arraylength call we have now? For a non-bufferview arraylength call, why does anything need to change?",
      "revId": "3be88fc1fe222e2abe101cc8fd2d8fec1eee11ef",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
